Package: renderdoc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: vulkan-tools
Description: Graphics frame-capture debugger
 RenderDoc is a free MIT-licensed stand-alone graphics debugger that allows
 quick and easy single-frame capture and detailed introspection of any
 application using Vulkan, D3D11, D3D12, OpenGL or OpenGL ES across Windows,
 Linux, Android and Apple platforms.
 .
 This package includes the qrenderdoc GUI, the renderdoccmd command-line
 tool, the librenderdoc capture/replay library and the Vulkan implicit layer.

Package: librenderdoc-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, renderdoc (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Graphics frame-capture debugger - development header
 RenderDoc is a free MIT-licensed stand-alone graphics debugger.
 .
 This package contains the public C API header (renderdoc_app.h) for
 injecting the RenderDoc capture layer into an application at runtime.
